  {
    "page": 1,
    "text": "Data Sheet\nEVGI\nPVG32/ECO80 Interface\nThe EVGI Interface enhances ECO80LS with PVG32\nand PVG16 performance features.\nThe EVGI, PVG32/ECO80 Interface combines PVG 32,\nPVG16 and ECO 80 into a single valve group. (Both\nPVG32 and ECO80LS assembly kits fasten into the\nEVGI module) (Compatible with T0 or non-T0 PVG32\nmodules.)\nBenefits\n• Increased fixed and variable pump flow capacity\nfrom PVG32 standard and mid-inlet\n• Increased safety disabling downstream ECO80LS\nfunctions using PVSKM\n• Prioritization of downstream ECO80LS functions\nusing PVSPM\nFeatures\n• Independent Pilot Pressure Reducing Part numbers interface\nValve for ECO80 EVHC / EVHCO\nDescription Part number\nactuation\n• Designed to align to single mounting EVGI-INTERFACE-ECO80LS-PPRV-A 11202147\nsurface\nInterface hydraulic schematic Comprehensive technical literature is\nonline at www.danfoss.com\n11202147\nPp Pp\nT0\nPVG32/16 Side ECO80 Side\nLS\nP\nT\n© Danfoss | November 2019 AI324384047850en-000101 | 1",
